JHSSI MANUSCRIPT SUBMISSION TEMPLATE
=====================================
Journal of Humanities and Social Sciences Invention (JHSSI)
ISSN: 2581-8791 | DOI: 10.32456/jhssi

1. TITLE: [Concise, informative title under 50 words]
2. AUTHOR(S): [Full Name, Affiliation, Email, ORCID - Included ONLY in the Identified Version]
3. ABSTRACT: [150-300 words scholarly summary]
4. KEYWORDS: [4-6 comma-separated terms]
5. INTRODUCTION: [Context, research problem, literature review, and clear contribution]
6. METHODOLOGY: [Research design, data collection, analytical framework, ethical approval]
7. RESULTS & DISCUSSION: [Empirical or theoretical findings, critical dialogue, implications]
8. CONCLUSION: [Summary of findings, limitations, future research directions]
9. REFERENCES: [APA 7th or Chicago 17th edition referencing style]

DOUBLE-BLIND PEER REVIEW NOTICE:
Authors must prepare two copies:
- Copy A: Identified Manuscript (with author names/institutions)
- Copy B: Anonymized Blind Manuscript (all author metadata, affiliations, and acknowledgments omitted)
